{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 164164, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 110514, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "地铁-地狱-指路贴", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1659754237, "updated_at": 1677985258, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1688540830, "last_at": 1691401859, "comment_count": 26, "status": 1, "summary": "前言一、什么是地狱二、为什么要打地狱三、怎么打地狱（奖励丰厚）一、什么是地狱详细内容请看《官方更新地狱公告整理》1、地狱属于地铁难度的延伸，分为弱、中、强三种。（“萌新群”大呼恶心“玄冥二佬”直呼坐牢", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/660927.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/85926.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_537/h_878/1069/159239/2022/6/20/472403.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 33, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 95209, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 71, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 164164, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">前言</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">一、什么是地狱&nbsp; &nbsp; 二、为什么要打地狱&nbsp; &nbsp; 三、怎么打地狱</span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; font-weight: 700;\">（奖励丰厚）</span><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; text-align: center;\">一、什么是地狱&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></div><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">详细内容请看《<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">官方更新地狱公告整理</span>》</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、地狱属于地铁难度的延伸，分为弱、中、强三种。（“<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">萌新群</span>”大呼恶心“<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">玄冥二佬<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;text-align:left;\">”</span></span>直呼坐牢）</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2、难度很高，新人还是量力而行吧估计没个半年难度是下不去了。（手游就是循序渐进不着急）</span></span></div></span><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">官方更新地狱公告整理</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.9999px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2022年7月21日新增地下难度“地狱之境”(Hellbound)</span></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">-</span>&nbsp;增加了可以获得装备融化剂、装备天然石的新难度\"</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">地狱之境</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">\"</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">-<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">难度在通关地下极难度时可以入场。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">- 地狱</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">之境</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">（Hellbound）难度与现有的地下难度不同，并进行一周，使用单独的入场门票。（前往地狱之境的入场门票每周一凌晨4点初始化。）</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">- 地狱之境(Hellbound)难度是可以</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">选择最</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">少5名，最多15名的天子进入副本，选择天子时无法变更及初始化。</span><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line3\" style=\"margin:0.13333rem0px;height:0.53333rem;width:712.781px;\"></div></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"1600\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/660927.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/660927.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/660927.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"1\" style=\"height:380px;width:227px;\"><img data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"1600\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/85926.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/85926.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/85926.png\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"2\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;height:380px;width:227px;\"><img data-width=\"537\" data-height=\"878\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_537/h_878/1069/159239/2022/6/20/472403.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_537/h_878/1069/159239/2022/6/20/472403.jpg\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_537/h_878/1069/159239/2022/6/20/472403.jpg\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"3\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;height:380px;width:227px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">▷在现有的地下内容中增加了新的难度\"地狱之境（Hellbound）\"，完成现有的\"极\"难度时，可以进入地狱之境(Hellbound)难度。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">▷在现有的地下难度选择画面和关卡中通过【</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">地狱之境转换</span><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">】按钮可以转换成地狱之境(Hellbound)模式。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">▷地狱之境(Hellbound)难度与现有地下入场门票不同，使用单独的入场门票。门票在每周一凌晨04点初始化。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">▷地狱之境(Hellbound)难度与现有的地下难度不同，并进行一周。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">▷共存在3个区域，每个区域由5个殖民地和15个战斗区组成。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">▷1区到3区可以分阶段完成。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">▷通关1~3区域的所有关卡时，可使用水晶重新入场（初始化）。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\">▷通过地下地狱之境，可以获得\"印记石\"的材料道具融化剂和新装备道具的材料\"天然石\"。</span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line1\" style=\"margin:0.13333rem0px;height:0.53333rem;width:712.781px;\"></div></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">【规则】</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"541\" data-height=\"900\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_541/h_900/1069/159239/2022/6/20/24595.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_541/h_900/1069/159239/2022/6/20/24595.png\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_541/h_900/1069/159239/2022/6/20/24595.png\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"4\" style=\"width:230px;height:382px;\"><img data-width=\"541\" data-height=\"900\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_541/h_900/1069/159239/2022/6/20/824911.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_541/h_900/1069/159239/2022/6/20/824911.png\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_541/h_900/1069/159239/2022/6/20/824911.png\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"5\" style=\"width:230px;height:382px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"1600\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/52116.png\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/52116.png\" class=\"lazy-img img-view-ele\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_960/h_1600/1069/159239/2022/6/20/52116.png\" lazy=\"loaded\" img-count=\"6\" style=\"width:230px;height:383px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);\">▷<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">选择最少5名，最多15名的天子池后，可以进入副本。（实际挑战为5V5的战斗）</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span><br style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ㄴ</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>选择天子时，只有在副本初始化时才能变更天子或初始化，请慎重选择。</span><br style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">▷ 仅限于到达点火的天子，可以参与地狱之境的难度。</span><br style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">▷ 天子每天04点恢复一定量的HP。</span><br style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">▷ 在战斗中死亡的天子在之后的战斗准备阶段可以使用水晶复活。</span><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></span></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"></span></span></div><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">▷ 制作印记石时使用的融化剂可在地狱之境获得。</span><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">▷ 新装备商品在地狱之境中可获得的天然石和印记石，并作为材料可在</span></span><span class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system se-weight-unset se-style-unset \" style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-weight:400!important;\">赫菲斯托斯</span></span><span style=\"\">的铁匠铺&gt;配方制作。</span></span></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div></span></span></div>\n                               </div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">3、官方计划开放地狱地铁的扫荡了通过一次即可，没有必要专门培养冷门地铁天子了。</span></span></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">二、为什么要打地狱（奖励丰厚）</span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1、相信仔细看过公告的玩家已经发现了，地狱这里的奖励是，制作强大的新装备，新附魔的材料，属性与特效比较逆天。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、装备详情请看《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/80674.html\" target=\"_blank\">装备节奏榜</a>》，S彩色附魔详情及评价《<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/162581.html\" target=\"_blank\">彩附魔图鉴</a>》。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、新装备多到毕业以后买材料可获得大量金币。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、由于扫荡的加入第一次通关虽然对于新人来说异常困难，但换算成金币奖励确实实在，建议下点功夫通关。</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></div></span><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/159239/2022/6/20/758670.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/159239/2022/6/20/758670.png\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/159239/2022/6/20/758670.png\" style=\"margin:auto;width:80px;height:80px;vertical-align:middle;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/159239/2022/6/20/747816.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/159239/2022/6/20/747816.png\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/159239/2022/6/20/747816.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; margin: auto; width: 80px; height: 80px; vertical-align: middle;\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/1069/159239/2022/6/20/777145.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_1